          "activities": [
            "Art Appreciation Activity – Look at pictures or art and discuss thoughts: \"What do you think about this?\" Observe if the child can express opinions about art. Purpose: Assesses appreciation, observation, and verbal expression. Music Appreciation – Listen to music and discuss feelings: \"How does this music make you feel?\" Observe if the child can express appreciation for music. Purpose: Assesses emotional awareness, appreciation, and expression. Creative Expression – Encourage creating and discussing their own art. Observe if the child shows pride and can describe their work. Purpose: Assesses creativity, self-expression, and appreciation."
          ],
